# Real rules, not a commented-out template. The repository this replaced was authored on
# Windows with CRLF throughout; normalizing on checkin is what stops the next cross-platform
# clone from showing every file as modified.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sln text eol=crlf
*.csproj text eol=lf
*.props text eol=lf
*.cs text eol=lf diff=csharp
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
